            "style": "box",
            "title": "When will my ring ship?",
            "content": "<p>Every Patrick Adair Designs ring is handmade, made to order. Each order is crafted by a highly-trained artisan with thought and integrity in an extremely time consuming process. Our lead times vary and are estimates. Production depends on a variety of factors including but not limited to - material availability, labor availability, and order volume. For a detailed breakdown on how quickly we are shipping our products, check out our <a href=\"https://patrickadairdesigns.com/pages/shipping-information\" target=\"_self\"><strong>Shipping Information </strong></a>page.</p>",
