            "style": "box",
            "title": "Where do you get your meteorite?",
            "content": "<p></p><p>All of our meteorite is currently sourced from meteorite dealers that we find either through eBay or that we know through personal connections. We use authentic and genuine Meteorite for all of our meteorite products.</p>",
